Tracking configuration: .github/todo-sync.json
Persistent recovery/baselines: .github/todo-sync-state.json
Contributor workflow: docs/DEVELOPMENT.md
Pre-write inventory: docs/tracking/2026-11-06-inventory.md

Identity and status rules:
  Keep Workstream ID stable through file/title/repository renames.
  Keep Status, Milestone, Dependencies, Purpose, Tasks, Acceptance criteria,
  Completion evidence and Completion log in every actual workstream.
  Use exact statuses, not composite prose. Blocked work names its blocker/stage.
  Each actual workstream has one issue and the same issue in the adopted Project.
  Indexes and this perpetual ledger are explicitly excluded.
  New files require an explicit public-safe configuration entry and preview.
  No automatic commits, pushes, board-to-file writes or background service.
